# Focal branding

When changing or adding UI in this project, follow the Focal brand guide in `docs/branding/`.

## Identity

- **Product name:** Focal (not "Video Recap")
- **Logo file:** `docs/branding/focal-logo.png` — official Canva logo (stacked rounded squares + white play icon)
- **Reference:** `docs/branding/focal-brand-guide.html` and `docs/branding/FOCAL-BRAND-GUIDE.md`

## Colors (sampled from logo — CSS variables recommended)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Primary | `#595FE7` | Buttons (Recap, Play segment), checkbox accent |
| Primary hover | `#4A50D4` | Button hover |
| Accent | `#ABB0F2` | Logo outline, highlights |
| Text / panel bg | `#0B1222` | Body on light UI, key moment panel background |
| Panel text | `#FFFFFF` | Text on dark panel |
| Popup bg | `#FFFFFF` | Pause popup, toolbar popup |
| Label | `#6B7280` | Uppercase section labels |

## Typography

- **Font:** Inter (Google Fonts), weights 400–700
- Section labels: 13px, semibold, uppercase, `#6B7280`
- Buttons: 14–15px, semibold, white on primary

## UI surfaces

1. **Pause popup** — white card, top-right on YouTube; "FOCAL" label, Recap button, Voiceover toggle
2. **Key moment panel** — dark `#0B1222`, bottom-right; nav arrows + Play segment button
3. **Toolbar popup** — same styling as pause popup

Do not reintroduce generic blue `#2563EB` or Arial unless explicitly requested.
